# Packed blobs under mock_template/m/ are ciphertext, not text. Without this,
# `core.autocrlf=true` checkouts fall back to git's NUL-byte heuristic, and a
# repack that happens to contain no NUL would get its CR/LF bytes rewritten -
# corrupting the blob and taking the whole suite down.
#
# Lives here rather than in mock_template/m/ because that directory's contents
# are staged into the sandbox verbatim.
mock_template/m/*.bin -text -diff
